# Sourced by phoenix-shell's product.env (luna-surfacemanager's
# surface-manager.sh sources that). This machine sets nothing: the output's
# geometry comes from com.webos.service.config
# (com.webos.surfacemanager.compositorGeometry), else surface-manager.sh's
# 1920x1080+0+0r0s1. A machine's own file (files/<MACHINE>/compositor.env)
# may set WEBOS_COMPOSITOR_GEOMETRY=<width>x<height>+<x>+<y>r<rotation>s<scale>.
